@expel_centrum
title: Expel part of Centrum PPS
subtitle: 1 R; 25% of its base leaves with voters and MPs; its dissent −15. Every purge waits 12 months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.unityStatus(Q, 'expel', 'centrum').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_unity_expel_centrum_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.unityChoose(Q, 'expel', 'centrum');
